packages/mcp/README.md

# why: contributor doc with placeholder env values for local-dev setup.
packages/mcp/CONTRIBUTING.md

# why: example code reads env vars and shows a placeholder default for
# documentation purposes; not a hardcoded real key.
examples/basic-usage/index.ts

# why: example README describes the same placeholder-env pattern as the
# main README.
examples/basic-usage/README.md

# why: Python-subproject README documents placeholder env values; not a
# real key.
python/README.md

